1
00:00:03,020 --> 00:00:04,620
亲爱的 你弄来些啥玩意儿啊
Honey, what is all this?

2
00:00:04,957 --> 00:00:08,126
老妈 我在纠结大学申请的论文题目
Hey, Mam, I'm trying to write these stupid college essay questions.

3
00:00:08,126 --> 00:00:09,826
但我真不知道该如何下笔
And I really even don't know how to start.

4
00:00:09,826 --> 00:00:11,285
好吧 告诉我是什么题目
OK, what's the question? Tell me.

5
00:00:11,285 --> 00:00:14,313
你有生以来遇到的需要克服的最大困难是什么
"what's the biggest obstacle you've ever had to overcome?"

6
00:00:14,313 --> 00:00:15,822
我三年级的老师是不是说
Didn't my third grade teacher say

7
00:00:15,822 --> 00:00:17,341
我有注意力不足症什么的
I had,Like, A.D.D. or something?

8
00:00:18,080 --> 00:00:21,360
不 宝贝儿 她是说你不会做加法
Oh, no, honey. She said you couldn't ADD.

9
00:00:21,380 --> 00:00:24,160
她用字母说明 是因为她知道你也不会拼写
and she put it that way because she also knew you couldn't s-p-e-l-l.

10
00:00:24,320 --> 00:00:26,460
等一下 慢点 原来如此啊
Wait,slow down... Oh...

11
00:00:26,545 --> 00:00:27,502
亲爱的
Sweet heart.

12
00:00:28,154 --> 00:00:29,090
究竟啥玩意儿
What's this?

13
00:00:29,090 --> 00:00:30,538
我们上周讨论过了不是吗
We talked about this last week.

14
00:00:30,538 --> 00:00:33,466
我说要给卢克建个小木屋 你说好吧
I said i'm building luke a tree house. You said "fine."

15
00:00:34,140 --> 00:00:36,340
有时候 我觉得你总是否定我要做的事
You know,sometimes I think you just tune me out.

16
00:00:37,060 --> 00:00:38,880
我从没跟她说过 因为肯定会被她一票否决
I never told her. She just would have said "No."

17
00:00:39,240 --> 00:00:41,735
菲尔 我不记得同意过这事儿
I don't remember agreeing to this, Phil.

18
00:00:41,735 --> 00:00:43,857
就像上次 你在车上装滑翔翼扮大雁
This is like the time you backed down the driveway

19
00:00:44,480 --> 00:00:46,120
倒出车道 都是先斩后奏
with a hang glider sticking out of the car.

20
00:00:46,220 --> 00:00:47,220
如果当初你不阻止我
If you'd let me keep that,

21
00:00:47,240 --> 00:00:48,820
那些鹅就会跟着我滑向湿地了
Those geese would have followed me to the wetlands.

22
00:00:48,960 --> 00:00:50,600
-你会死的 -死的光荣
-You would have died. -A hero.

23
00:00:52,961 --> 00:00:55,124
于是我们铺开毯子
So we spread out a nice blanket,

24
00:00:55,124 --> 00:00:57,035
打开一瓶红酒
opened up a bottle of vino,

25
00:00:57,035 --> 00:00:59,037
然后欣赏日落海平线
and watched the sun set over the water.

26
00:00:59,037 --> 00:01:01,008
好壮丽哦
It was majestic.

27
00:01:01,660 --> 00:01:02,220
非常壮丽
Majestic.

28
00:01:02,440 --> 00:01:04,680
为什么我们从来不去野餐
Why? Why we never have the picnic?

29
00:01:04,860 --> 00:01:07,060
谁喜欢坐在毯子上啊 连个靠背都没有
Who wants to sit on a blanket? There's no back support.

30
00:01:07,380 --> 00:01:08,320
但好壮丽的
It's majestic.

31
00:01:09,020 --> 00:01:12,360
上周"小短"带我去看太阳竞技团演出
Last week, Shorty took me to see the cirque du soleil--

32
00:01:12,700 --> 00:01:15,340
有点像马戏团表演 不过更高雅
It's like a circus, but classy.

33
00:01:15,800 --> 00:01:17,620
所以如果你喜欢大象的话
So if you like elephants,

34
00:01:17,620 --> 00:01:18,760
赶紧去看吧
don't hold your breath.

35
00:01:18,980 --> 00:01:19,840
我老婆可爱吧
She's so cute.

36
00:01:20,544 --> 00:01:24,356
杰总是嫌人多 讨厌海滩 厌恶彩虹
Jay hates the crowds, the beach, the rainbows.

37
00:01:24,356 --> 00:01:26,610
彩虹 不就是天上多点颜色嘛
Rainbows? It's just colors in the sky.

38
00:01:26,610 --> 00:01:28,974
至于每次看到都停车拍照吗
Do we have to pull over every time and take a picture?

39
00:01:28,974 --> 00:01:31,720
真可惜 意大利有句俗话说得好 杰
Shame. There's an expression in Italian, Jay--

40
00:01:31,720 --> 00:01:37,202
执子之手 与子偕老
Dammi la tua mano e corriamo uniti per tutta la vita.

41
00:01:37,202 --> 00:01:41,156
"手牵手 我们一起走 把你一生交给我"
"Give me your hand and we will run together our whole lives."

42
00:01:41,679 --> 00:01:43,379
杰也不喜欢"走"
Jay also hates running.

43
00:01:57,280 --> 00:01:58,400
您点的东西
Here you go.

44
00:01:58,460 --> 00:01:59,440
谢谢
Oh, thank you.

45
00:01:59,520 --> 00:02:02,200
-这是您的 -噢 这是什么
-And here you go. -Oh. What is this?

46
00:02:02,512 --> 00:02:04,202
您说要让您"哇"地一声惊喜嘛
You said to knock your socks off.

47
00:02:04,202 --> 00:02:06,566
快看 "袜"子已经不见了哦
Oh, well, look. It's already working!

48
00:02:07,431 --> 00:02:08,427
好吧 再来两杯
Well, two more of those,

49
00:02:08,520 --> 00:02:10,140
估计你连内裤都没了哦
and you won't be wearing any underwear either.

50
00:02:10,590 --> 00:02:12,390
-快看 我内裤也 -小卡 坐下坐下
-Oh! Look... -Cam, down. Down.

51
00:02:12,390 --> 00:02:15,991
-过后再给我看吧 -好吧 过后再说
-Maybe later. -Oh, okay, maybe... Maybe later.

52
00:02:16,223 --> 00:02:18,003
你听到吗 那服务员正在跟我调情呢
Did you hear that? Waitress is flirting with me.

53
00:02:18,003 --> 00:02:19,442
不 她没跟你调情
No, no. She's not flirting with you.

54
00:02:19,442 --> 00:02:21,705
只不过是她要小费的伎俩而已
She's--she's trolling for tips, okay?

55
00:02:21,705 --> 00:02:23,274
她一眼就看出你是同性恋了
She totally knows you're gay.

56
00:02:23,274 --> 00:02:24,884
少来了 怎么可能看出来
How would she know I'm gay?

57
00:02:24,884 --> 00:02:27,872
或许是你点那杯酒的方式吧
Uh, maybe it's the way you ordered a drink-a-doodle-doo.

58
00:02:28,480 --> 00:02:30,780
小卡一直痴人说梦 说自己如果是直男
Cam has this crazy theory that if he were straight...

59
00:02:31,121 --> 00:02:33,042
而朱莉亚·罗伯茨单身的话
And Julia Roberts were single...

60
00:02:33,042 --> 00:02:34,712
-他们早就搞到一起了 -才不是痴人说梦
-They'd be dating. -It's not crazy.

61
00:02:34,712 --> 00:02:36,050
我在反歧视艾滋活动中见过她一次
I met her once at an A.I.D.S. Walk,

62
00:02:36,050 --> 00:02:37,659
当时我们火花四溅啊
and our chemistry was palpable.

63
00:02:37,659 --> 00:02:39,189
不 你只不过给了她一瓶水
No, you handed her a bottle of water.

64
00:02:39,189 --> 00:02:40,144
可她的手指在勾搭我
And her fingers lingered.

65
00:02:40,144 --> 00:02:41,654
那是因为你死不放手
Because you wouldn't let go.

66
00:02:43,140 --> 00:02:45,100
在场的所有妹子 爷我想钓谁都能上钩
I could totally pick up any woman in here.

67
00:02:45,220 --> 00:02:47,000
如果你说的上钩 是指把她抱起离开地面
If by that, you mean lift her off the ground,

68
00:02:47,260 --> 00:02:48,640
那我承认 你绝对够力气
then yes, I'll give you that.

69
00:02:48,760 --> 00:02:50,260
爷天生拥有"情场必杀技"
I for sure could be a womanizer.

70
00:02:50,440 --> 00:02:51,460
恐怕你是个变性人
Or you could be someone

71
00:02:51,460 --> 00:02:53,440
刚刚从"女人变身机"里走出来的
who just stepped out of a machine called the womanizer.

72
00:02:54,240 --> 00:02:55,600
好吧 受够你们的讽刺了
Okay, you know what? That's it.

73
00:02:55,760 --> 00:02:56,780
随便挑个妞儿
Pick anyone in here.

74
00:02:56,920 --> 00:02:58,980
如果我能拿到她的电话号码 你就洗一个月的衣服
If I can get their number, you do the laundry for a month.

75
00:02:59,000 --> 00:03:00,900
如果失败了 爷来洗
If I fail, I'll do it.

76
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:03,880
好吧 洗衣服什么的最讨厌了 就...
Okay. I hate doing laundry. So, um...

77
00:03:03,880 --> 00:03:06,080
那个不行
No, um...

78
00:03:06,080 --> 00:03:07,480
好吧 就这个
Oh, okay. Right here.

79
00:03:08,340 --> 00:03:08,600
她
Her.

80
00:03:12,260 --> 00:03:12,980
好 成交
Okay, great.

81
00:03:13,820 --> 00:03:16,500
很好 先去一下我的基味
Great. Just get rid of my flair...

82
00:03:18,240 --> 00:03:19,920
哇 我们熟悉的小卡哪去了
Whoa. Where did Cam go?

83
00:03:20,462 --> 00:03:22,525
不知道啊 脱胎换骨了啊
I don't know. Where is he?

84
00:03:23,580 --> 00:03:25,340
晚餐实在太丰盛了
Dinner was absolutely wonderful.

85
00:03:25,740 --> 00:03:26,220
太美妙了
Amazing.

86
00:03:26,640 --> 00:03:27,200
对了
Hey, you know what?

87
00:03:27,240 --> 00:03:29,340
明天一起去跳莎莎舞吧
Why don't you guys come salsa dancing with us tomorrow night?

88
00:03:29,360 --> 00:03:31,220
对啊 一起跳很欢乐哦
Oh, yeah! That would be great!

89
00:03:31,340 --> 00:03:33,360
听起来很诱人 我最爱莎莎了
It sounds like so much fun. I love salsa dancing.

90
00:03:33,600 --> 00:03:35,780
杰 我们去跳吧 快看
Jay, let's go salsa dancing with them. Look.

91
00:03:37,160 --> 00:03:37,940
为什么不去
Why not?

92
00:03:38,720 --> 00:03:40,600
我刚买了按次计费的拳击票
I just bought that pay-per-view fight.

93
00:03:41,064 --> 00:03:42,543
那我们互相妥协一下吧
I tell you what-- we'll compromise.

94
00:03:42,543 --> 00:03:44,836
我们去看拳赛 然后去吃"莎莎"
We'll watch the fight. We'll eat salsa.

95
00:03:44,836 --> 00:03:46,657
别带他去了 咱仨去跳吧
Who needs him? Come dancing with us.

96
00:03:46,657 --> 00:03:47,784
算了 我不想当灯泡
Ay, no, I wouldn't want to--

97
00:03:47,784 --> 00:03:50,047
没有啊 你来可是帮我大忙了
No, no! You'd be doing me a favor.

98
00:03:50,047 --> 00:03:53,347
"小短"一跳起来就停不下 让我偶尔歇歇也好
Shorty never wants to stop, and I could use a break.

99
00:03:53,347 --> 00:03:55,187
你听到了吗 杰 我一跳就停不下来哦
You hear that Jay? I never stop.

100
00:03:55,187 --> 00:03:57,451
我只听到她说想喘口气
All I hear is she could use a break.

101
00:03:59,460 --> 00:04:01,740
嗨 天哪 你好吗
Hey! Oh, my god! How are you?

102
00:04:04,380 --> 00:04:08,000
哇 你看起来美极了
Wow. Look at you. You look fantastic.

103
00:04:08,200 --> 00:04:10,080
谢谢 你也是
Thank you. So do you.

104
00:04:10,200 --> 00:04:11,420
我们多久没见了
How long has it been?

105
00:04:12,200 --> 00:04:14,000
-宛如隔世啊 -是啊
-It feels like forever. -Yeah.

106
00:04:14,763 --> 00:04:17,600
我们上次见面是什么时候来着
Um, when is the last time we saw each other?

107
00:04:17,600 --> 00:04:19,702
我想想 好像还是在达夫办的什么活动上吧
Oh, let's see. I think it was at Dave's thing.

108
00:04:19,920 --> 00:04:22,000
好吧 我很抱歉
You know what? I'm sorry.

109
00:04:22,880 --> 00:04:24,220
不知道你听说没有
I don't know if you've heard.

110
00:04:24,420 --> 00:04:26,460
我遭遇了一次可怕的车祸
I was in a terrible car accident,

111
00:04:26,460 --> 00:04:28,780
自从那次昏迷以后
And ever since the coma,

112
00:04:29,280 --> 00:04:33,320
我就记不得谁是谁了
I have a really hard time placing names and faces.

113
00:04:33,760 --> 00:04:35,040
请问你是谁
So who are you again?

114
00:04:35,040 --> 00:04:36,200
噢 天啊 我真抱歉
Oh, my god. I am so sorry.

115
00:04:36,240 --> 00:04:37,800
我只是在跟你套近乎
It was just a clever way to try to approach you.

116
00:04:37,840 --> 00:04:39,240
我们压根儿不认识
We don't know each other.

117
00:04:40,180 --> 00:04:41,680
其实根本就没昏迷这件事儿
I've never been in a coma.

118
00:04:42,440 --> 00:04:47,180
你自找的 你的搭讪太糟糕了
But you so deserved that. That was the worst pick-up ever.

119
00:04:47,280 --> 00:04:49,340
我的神呀
Oh, my god!

120
00:04:49,340 --> 00:04:52,380
你个小滑头 真讨厌
That was genius! And mean!

121
00:04:52,980 --> 00:04:56,120
现在我知道为什么我们是伪老友了
Now I know why we're old fake friends.

122
00:04:56,580 --> 00:04:58,560
不介意请你喝一杯吧
Oh. Can I buy you a drink?

123
00:04:58,700 --> 00:05:00,140
行啊 我叫凯蒂
Yeah. I'm Katie.

124
00:05:00,840 --> 00:05:01,320
我叫卡梅隆
Cameron.

125
00:05:02,300 --> 00:05:03,260
如果她是一个俊男
If she were a hot guy,

126
00:05:03,260 --> 00:05:05,320
我不可能那么顺利上手的
I would never have been that smooth.

127
00:05:05,680 --> 00:05:06,600
真是讽刺
It's ironic.

128
00:05:06,660 --> 00:05:08,340
就像《玛琪的礼物》
Like the gift of the vagi.

129
00:05:13,410 --> 00:05:14,658
好了
There you go.

130
00:05:14,768 --> 00:05:16,297
谢谢 很高兴认识你
Thank you. Nice to meet you.

131
00:05:16,297 --> 00:05:19,254
-我也是 拜拜 -拜
- You, too. Bye! - Bye!

132
00:05:20,069 --> 00:05:21,849
哦也 承让承让
Wham, bam, thank you, Cam.

133
00:05:21,849 --> 00:05:23,419
太假了 你搞到她电话了
Seriously? You got her number?

134
00:05:23,419 --> 00:05:25,320
当然 记得把我的衬衫熨一下
Sure did. and all my shirts get ironed,

135
00:05:25,320 --> 00:05:26,939
接缝要熨得笔直哦
And their seams should appear straight,

136
00:05:26,939 --> 00:05:28,490
要比直男主人还直哦
Just like their owner.

137
00:05:33,478 --> 00:05:36,526
不该用钉子吧 该用螺丝不是吗
Should you be using screws instead of nails?

138
00:05:36,647 --> 00:05:38,950
美国就是钉子建造起来的 孩子
America was built with nails, son.

139
00:05:39,272 --> 00:05:42,431
你国庆节派对上造的露台也是用的钉子
So was that gazebo you built for our 4th of July party.

140
00:05:43,065 --> 00:05:46,083
跟你说 你会喜欢上这个树屋的
I'm telling you, you are gonna love this bad boy.

141
00:05:46,083 --> 00:05:47,903
你知道什么东西爬不上来吗
You know what can't climb trees?

142
00:05:47,994 --> 00:05:48,939
浣熊嘛
Raccoons?

143
00:05:48,939 --> 00:05:50,318
是烦恼
Worries.

144
00:05:50,489 --> 00:05:51,756
浣熊会爬树 也迟早会爬上来的
Raccoons can and will get up here,

145
00:05:51,756 --> 00:05:52,601
所以不要在这里留吃的
so don't leave any food,

146
00:05:52,601 --> 00:05:55,086
要不它们就会为保护地盘而攻击你
or they'll get territorial and attack.

147
00:05:55,659 --> 00:05:57,601
你确定这是个好主意吗
Are you sure this is a good idea?

148
00:05:57,601 --> 00:05:58,586
开玩笑
Are you kidding me?

149
00:05:58,586 --> 00:06:01,202
将来你和你的小伙伴们会在这儿玩得很开心的
You're gonna have so much fun hanging out up here with your buddies.

150
00:06:02,460 --> 00:06:04,120
相信我 等你长大了 一切都会不同了
Trust me, when you get older, it all changes.

151
00:06:04,680 --> 00:06:06,640
-为什么 -生活所迫
- Why? - Well, life gets in the way.

152
00:06:07,328 --> 00:06:08,636
我是不是说了"老婆所迫"
Did I just say "Wife gets in the way"?

153
00:06:08,636 --> 00:06:10,025
有时候我会说错
'cause sometimes I do that.

154
00:06:10,034 --> 00:06:11,352
没有 没说错
Nope, you're good.

155
00:06:11,634 --> 00:06:13,243
你还有很多朋友
And you have lots of friends.

156
00:06:13,243 --> 00:06:14,219
是啊 我有工作上的朋友
Yeah, I have work friends,

157
00:06:14,219 --> 00:06:16,070
我和你妈还有夫妻档朋友
And your mom and I have couples friends,

158
00:06:16,070 --> 00:06:18,062
还有我大学朋友
And there are my college friends,

159
00:06:18,062 --> 00:06:20,063
但是他们各奔前程了
But they're scattered all over the country.

160
00:06:20,063 --> 00:06:21,401
不像以前对着
It's not the same as just shouting out

161
00:06:21,401 --> 00:06:22,689
邻居朋友吼一声
to your neighborhood buddies,

162
00:06:22,689 --> 00:06:24,942
"伙计们 我在树屋上呢" 嗷
"Hey, fellas! I'm up here in the tree house!" Uhh!

163
00:06:27,500 --> 00:06:29,060
得修一修这个 地板
Fix that... board.

164
00:06:31,652 --> 00:06:33,202
做不来啊
I can't do this.

165
00:06:34,640 --> 00:06:36,040
你火什么火
Why are you so frustrated?

166
00:06:36,300 --> 00:06:38,840
因为从来就没有什么困难需要我克服
Because I've never had any obstacles to overcome.

167
00:06:39,200 --> 00:06:40,940
亲爱的 可不是这样的
Oh, honey, that's not true.

168
00:06:40,940 --> 00:06:42,640
是吗 举个例
Really? Name one.

169
00:06:44,649 --> 00:06:46,319
你有乳糖不耐受症
You're lactose-intolerant.

170
00:06:46,379 --> 00:06:48,954
哦 "亲爱的大学 奶酪让我屁多多
Oh, "Dear college, cheese makes me gassy.

171
00:06:48,954 --> 00:06:50,141
9月见"
See you in September."

172
00:06:50,141 --> 00:06:51,720
亲爱的 你该不会把"亲爱的大学"作为
Sweetie, you're not really starting your essays

173
00:06:51,720 --> 00:06:53,783
你论文的开头吧
"Dear college," Are you?

174
00:06:53,783 --> 00:06:55,020
那又怎么了
What difference does it make?

175
00:06:55,020 --> 00:06:57,766
我活在你们的庇护下 日子无聊而苦逼
I've lived a boring, sheltered, pathetic life.

176
00:06:57,766 --> 00:07:01,136
让你日子过得太滋润了 真是对不起啊
I am sorry we have made things too easy and comfortable for you.

177
00:07:01,136 --> 00:07:04,415
你应该道歉 都是你的错
Oh, you should be! It is all your fault!

178
00:07:04,415 --> 00:07:05,562
你老是护着我
You have shielded me

179
00:07:05,562 --> 00:07:08,419
任何有趣和危险的事情都不让我去干
from everything interesting and dangerous!

180
00:07:08,419 --> 00:07:09,767
你是在指责我
You are blaming me

181
00:07:09,767 --> 00:07:12,312
保护你不受伤害吗
because I kept you from getting hurt?

182
00:07:12,312 --> 00:07:13,992
加布的妈妈是收藏癖
Gaby's mom's a hoarder.

183
00:07:14,700 --> 00:07:16,580
她写论文就毫无障碍
That essay practically writes itself.

184
00:07:17,800 --> 00:07:18,860
可能是我们的错
Maybe it is our fault.

185
00:07:19,120 --> 00:07:22,300
但是你有没有想过原因
But did you ever consider there's a reason?

186
00:07:23,260 --> 00:07:24,280
你在说什么
What are you talking about?

187
00:07:26,274 --> 00:07:29,292
我们对你那么娇惯 是有原因的
There's a reason why we were so easy on you.

188
00:07:29,292 --> 00:07:30,822
我迷糊了
I don't understand.

189
00:07:30,992 --> 00:07:32,934
亲爱的 你已经不小了
Oh, honey, you're old enough now.

190
00:07:32,934 --> 00:07:33,990
什么不小了
Old enough for what?

191
00:07:33,990 --> 00:07:35,076
该告诉你真相了
The truth.

192
00:07:35,076 --> 00:07:38,004
跟我来 给你看样东西
Okay, come on. Gotta show you somethin'.

193
00:07:38,004 --> 00:07:39,373
我们要开车去
We're gonna go for a ride.

194
00:07:40,300 --> 00:07:41,860
妈 跟我说就是了嘛
Mom, just tell me.

195
00:07:43,020 --> 00:07:44,040
你是我亲妈 对吧
You are my mom, right?

196
00:07:47,450 --> 00:07:48,536
我是个坏人
I'm a bad man.

197
00:07:48,536 --> 00:07:50,085
哦 不 你吃啥了
Oh, no. What did you eat?

198
00:07:50,085 --> 00:07:52,992
米奇尔 记得昨天晚上那女孩吗
Mitchell, remember the girl I met last night?

199
00:07:52,992 --> 00:07:54,028
终身难忘啊
How can I forget her?

200
00:07:54,028 --> 00:07:56,453
她的"辨基能力"全世界倒数第一
She's super famous for having the world's worst gay-dar.

201
00:07:56,453 --> 00:07:59,420
我怎么能无视她的感情呢
How could I be so cavalier with her emotions?

202
00:07:59,900 --> 00:08:01,420
你知道我们心有灵犀
You know, we had a real connection.

203
00:08:01,480 --> 00:08:02,640
她把电话给了我
She gave me her number,

204
00:08:02,660 --> 00:08:04,740
现在她很可能坐在电话旁边
And right now she's probably sitting by the phone

205
00:08:04,740 --> 00:08:06,020
等我的电话
waiting for me to call.

206
00:08:08,740 --> 00:08:11,280
我觉得你不懂我让她多着迷
I don't think you understand how charmed she was by me.

207
00:08:11,400 --> 00:08:13,340
老天 你这自信从哪里来的
Oh, my god. Where did you get all this self-confidence?

208
00:08:14,420 --> 00:08:17,580
1974年的杰斯珀集市会上 我赢得了最可爱宝宝奖
I won cutest baby at the 1974 Jasper County Fair.

209
00:08:17,940 --> 00:08:19,500
那时人们说我像嘉小宝
People at the time said I could go Gerber.

210
00:08:19,980 --> 00:08:21,760
我决定了 我要打电话给她
You know what? I'm calling her.

211
00:08:22,060 --> 00:08:22,500
什么
What?

212
00:08:22,820 --> 00:08:24,940
不行 我不能一直拖着
No, I can't carry this around.

213
00:08:25,200 --> 00:08:27,720
我得跟她说实话 让她放下我
I have to come clean so she can move on with her life.

214
00:08:27,880 --> 00:08:29,980
这太疯狂了 人家才不会等
This is crazy. She is not waiting--

215
00:08:30,140 --> 00:08:32,080
嘿 凯蒂 我是小卡
Hi. Katie. It's Cam.

216
00:08:33,160 --> 00:08:33,820
电话一响她就接了
First ring.

217
00:08:34,980 --> 00:08:37,660
我也很期待打电话给你
I was hoping I would call, too.

218
00:08:37,700 --> 00:08:38,420
真顺啊
Oh, smooth.

219
00:08:38,541 --> 00:08:41,147
昨晚 我有些事没有说
So listen, I forgot to mention something last night,

220
00:08:41,147 --> 00:08:45,533
我不知道该如何说起
and I'm--I'm actually not really quite sure how to say this.

221
00:08:45,780 --> 00:08:46,820
我是个同志
I'm a gay guy.

222
00:08:49,084 --> 00:08:50,633
其实是个比较微妙的话题
Um, it's actually somewhat delicate.

223
00:08:50,633 --> 00:08:52,584
就像我一样娇柔 因为我是同志
As am I, on account of the gay.

224
00:08:52,906 --> 00:08:55,069
不 凯蒂 那天我也聊得很愉快
No, no, I had a great time with you, too, Katie.

225
00:08:55,069 --> 00:08:56,467
只是 只是
It's--well, it's just that--

226
00:08:56,720 --> 00:08:59,140
-我对妹子不敢兴趣 -不 你坐下来
- I don't dig the ladies. - No, no. And I want you to sit--

227
00:08:59,140 --> 00:09:01,060
你先在卧榻上坐稳了
I want you to have a seat on a chaise lounge.

228
00:09:02,302 --> 00:09:03,609
想在比赛开始前
Hey, you wanna go out and

229
00:09:03,609 --> 00:09:04,907
出去吃个晚饭吗
grab some dinner before the fight tonight?

230
00:09:05,120 --> 00:09:06,660
不用 多谢了
No, thank you.

231
00:09:06,738 --> 00:09:08,056
想在家里自己开伙吗
Wanna eat at home?

232
00:09:08,220 --> 00:09:10,780
我来烤点牛排 开瓶小酒
I'll grill some steaks, open a bottle of wine.

233
00:09:10,980 --> 00:09:13,080
随你便 我晚上要出去
Whatever you want, because I'm not going to be here.

234
00:09:13,580 --> 00:09:16,520
她要出去跳莎莎舞 居然不带我
She's going Salsa Dancing without me.

235
00:09:16,576 --> 00:09:20,489
曼尼 我说了那俱乐部得年满21岁才能进
Ay, Manny, I told you, it's a 21 and over club.

236
00:09:20,489 --> 00:09:22,994
小学生禁入的舞所 才散发致命的诱惑
A forbidden dance floor. Only makes me want it more.

237
00:09:22,994 --> 00:09:26,746
等一下 你要同"小短"和达琳去跳舞吗
Wait a second. You're going dancing with Shorty and Darlene?

238
00:09:26,820 --> 00:09:29,000
没错 虽然他和你年纪一样大
Yes, because even though he's old like you,

239
00:09:29,000 --> 00:09:30,680
可他仍然喜欢出去找乐子
he still likes to have fun.

240
00:09:30,680 --> 00:09:31,880
我们也喜欢找乐子啊
We like to have fun.

241
00:09:32,480 --> 00:09:33,860
上周我还带你去吃晚饭了呢
Last week I took you to dinner,

242
00:09:34,300 --> 00:09:35,440
还看了船展
went to the boat show,

243
00:09:35,900 --> 00:09:37,299
还品尝了冰冻果子露
got some sherbet?

244
00:09:37,299 --> 00:09:39,823
结果一艘船也没买 才8点半就回家了
And we were home by 8:30 with no boat.

245
00:09:39,823 --> 00:09:42,117
你想要我怎么做 我不喜欢跳舞
What do you want from me? I don't like dancing.

246
00:09:42,117 --> 00:09:43,938
-我还不喜欢果子露呢 -是吗
- I don't like sherbet. - Yeah, right.

247
00:09:43,938 --> 00:09:45,256
那椰子呢
How about coconut?

248
00:09:45,577 --> 00:09:48,243
谁不喜欢椰子啊 谁 谁啊
Who doesn't like the coconut, hmm? Who?

249
00:09:48,243 --> 00:09:49,943
不管你去不去 反正我要去跳舞
And anyways, I'm going dancing with or without you.

250
00:09:49,943 --> 00:09:52,247
行 我祝你和"小短"玩得愉快
Fine. I hope you have a good time with Shorty.

251
00:09:52,247 --> 00:09:53,917
我才不要和"小短"跳
I don't need Shorty!

252
00:09:53,917 --> 00:09:57,588
我随便找个舞伴 简直手到擒来
I won't have any problem finding a partner on my own!

253
00:09:58,060 --> 00:09:59,680
妈 你又戳到我的痛处了
Wow. Way to rub it in, mom.

254
00:10:04,120 --> 00:10:05,300
谈得如何啊 爱情杀手
How'd it go, heartbreaker?

255
00:10:05,480 --> 00:10:07,800
她真是个优雅的女士
That is one classy lady...

256
00:10:08,100 --> 00:10:10,100
-所以我对她开不了口 -啥
- Which is why I couldn't tell her. - What?

257
00:10:10,625 --> 00:10:12,537
我没法在电话上说这事
Well... I just couldn't do it on the phone.

258
00:10:12,537 --> 00:10:14,699
她接到我的电话时那么开心
She seemed so excited to hear from me,

259
00:10:14,699 --> 00:10:17,758
我又不擅长伤别人的心 米奇尔
and I'm very bad at disappointing people, Mitchell.

260
00:10:17,758 --> 00:10:18,895
我心已伤
Not all people.

261
00:10:18,920 --> 00:10:20,180
我妈说的对
Mama was right when she said

262
00:10:20,180 --> 00:10:22,020
她说我的魅力好比脱缰的种马
my charm was like a wild stallion--

263
00:10:22,280 --> 00:10:24,560
如果控制不当 定将毁家灭棚
If not properly bridled, it'll bust down a barn.

264
00:10:25,101 --> 00:10:26,972
你想甩掉你的女友吗
Okay, you wanna get rid of your girlfriend?

265
00:10:26,972 --> 00:10:28,159
把你妈的话复述一遍就是了
Tell her that story.

266
00:10:28,159 --> 00:10:30,845
她过来时我会说的 她一会儿就到
Maybe I will when she comes over. She's coming over.

267
00:10:30,845 --> 00:10:32,394
你没开玩笑吧
Are you serious?

268
00:10:32,394 --> 00:10:34,124
她说她正在附近办事
She said she was in the area running errands.

269
00:10:34,124 --> 00:10:36,156
那我能说什么 别来我家
What was I supposed to say, "Don't come over"?

270
00:10:36,156 --> 00:10:37,254
也许我是该那么说
Well, I guess I could have said that,

271
00:10:37,263 --> 00:10:38,440
可为时已晚
but it's too late now,

272
00:10:38,440 --> 00:10:40,070
而且我想温柔地和她分手
Plus I wanna break it to her gently.

273
00:10:40,100 --> 00:10:41,830
所以 快来帮我将此地"去基化"
So come on. Help me un-gay this place.

274
00:10:41,850 --> 00:10:43,852
我干脆走掉 就少了一半基味了
You know what? I'll make it less gay by half.

275
00:10:43,862 --> 00:10:45,159
这些花也得藏起来
Oh, these flowers should go, too.

276
00:10:45,169 --> 00:10:46,105
你是说那些放在
You mean the ones underneath

277
00:10:46,105 --> 00:10:47,756
你和某男勾肩搭背的照片下的花吗
the portrait of you cuddling another man?

278
00:10:47,785 --> 00:10:49,867
说得对
Oh, good catch.

279
00:10:53,060 --> 00:10:53,420
曼尼
Manny.

280
00:10:54,120 --> 00:10:54,840
什么事 老爹
What's up, big guy?

281
00:10:55,440 --> 00:10:58,100
那个莎莎舞是不是很难学
How hard is it to learn this salsa dancing stuff?

282
00:10:58,300 --> 00:10:59,140
一点都不难
Not hard at all.

283
00:10:59,140 --> 00:11:01,420
重点是在舞步中带入你的感情
It's about tapping into your emotion,

284
00:11:01,620 --> 00:11:03,800
你的激情 你心中暗藏的火焰
your passion, and your inner fire.

285
00:11:04,544 --> 00:11:06,636
狗屁
Crap!

286
00:11:07,220 --> 00:11:08,628
我跳舞超烂
I stink at dancing.

287
00:11:08,628 --> 00:11:09,805
我们跳婚礼上的第一支舞时
First dance at our wedding,

288
00:11:09,805 --> 00:11:11,907
歌洛莉亚集优雅与华丽为一身
Gloria was all graceful and gorgeous,

289
00:11:11,928 --> 00:11:13,990
我则是又笨又拙的大块头
and I was all big and clunky.

290
00:11:14,000 --> 00:11:16,152
就像动画片《美女与野兽》里的那一幕
Like that scene from "Beauty and the beast."

291
00:11:16,152 --> 00:11:17,943
事实上 我们用的就是同名主题曲
Actually, that was the song.

292
00:11:17,963 --> 00:11:19,583
是曼尼选的
Manny picked it.

293
00:11:19,583 --> 00:11:21,615
当时他诚心让我出丑
He didn't like me back then.

294
00:11:22,500 --> 00:11:23,960
背挺直 很好
Back straight. Okay.

295
00:11:23,960 --> 00:11:25,400
跟我一起做
Do as I do.

296
00:11:26,300 --> 00:11:27,100
另一只脚
Other leg.

297
00:11:27,900 --> 00:11:28,860
别像行军一样
Okay, stop marching.

298
00:11:28,940 --> 00:11:30,180
你是在跳舞 不是德军入侵波兰
You're dancing, not invading Poland.

299
00:11:38,880 --> 00:11:39,840
爷俩好啊
Hello, hi!

300
00:11:41,160 --> 00:11:42,478
我想找一下杰·普里契特
I'm looking for Jay Pritchett.

301
00:11:42,478 --> 00:11:44,168
他身高188 硬汉一个
He's about 6'2", tough guy,

302
00:11:44,188 --> 00:11:45,949
努力克服着恐同症
wrestles with homophobia...

303
00:11:45,969 --> 00:11:46,713
你来这干嘛
The hell are you doing here?

304
00:11:46,713 --> 00:11:48,554
我得离开家门
Uh, I had to get out of the house.

305
00:11:48,815 --> 00:11:51,793
小卡和他的新女友要单独处处
Cam needed a little alone time with his new girlfriend.

306
00:11:51,803 --> 00:11:53,503
-别问 -别说
- Don't ask. - Don't tell.

307
00:11:53,996 --> 00:11:55,062
你们在干嘛
What's going on here?

308
00:11:55,062 --> 00:11:57,487
他在学怎么跳舞 可他太僵硬
He's learning to dance, but he's just so tense.

309
00:11:57,497 --> 00:11:59,277
-完全不行 -因为你放不开自己
- It's not working out. - 'cause you're not letting go.

310
00:11:59,277 --> 00:12:01,299
我尽力了 你以为我不想舞步翩翩
I'm trying. Don't you think I want to be all smooth

311
00:12:01,309 --> 00:12:03,160
博得你妈笑开颜吗
and make your mom happy out there?

312
00:12:03,160 --> 00:12:04,880
可我就是不会跳舞 就这样
But I just can't do it, that's all.

313
00:12:04,890 --> 00:12:06,922
杰 我不会放弃你的
Jay, I'm not giving up on you.

314
00:12:07,627 --> 00:12:10,041
好了 曼尼 能让我们单独聊聊吗
Okay. Hey, Manny, would you give us a second?

315
00:12:10,081 --> 00:12:11,741
谢了
Thanks.

316
00:12:11,741 --> 00:12:14,427
爸 我知道这样做有点怪
Dad, look, I-I know this is weird,

317
00:12:14,437 --> 00:12:16,268
但我们爷俩其实很像
but you and I are a lot alike.

318
00:12:16,288 --> 00:12:17,998
我们都太扭捏了
We're self-conscious, okay?

319
00:12:18,018 --> 00:12:20,955
所以 这个
So, um, here. Just...

320
00:12:20,965 --> 00:12:21,830
这是啥玩意儿
The hell is this?

321
00:12:21,830 --> 00:12:23,903
就是有些人会在夜店吃的那种东西
It's just something that some people take at clubs

322
00:12:23,903 --> 00:12:25,563
用来放松自己
to, you know, loosen up.

323
00:12:25,563 --> 00:12:27,093
你吃过这玩意儿?
You take this?

324
00:12:27,102 --> 00:12:28,661
一个痛恨跳舞的基佬
A gay man who hates dancing

325
00:12:28,681 --> 00:12:30,039
只能烂在自己的孤独小世界里
Lives in a sad and lonely little world.

326
00:12:30,059 --> 00:12:31,850
这玩意儿能让你不再拘谨
This just melts your inhibitions,

327
00:12:31,870 --> 00:12:33,670
让你激情欢跳一整晚
And--and you can dance all night,

328
00:12:33,680 --> 00:12:35,211
同时也能让你"性致"大发...
Plus it gives you a raging--

329
00:12:35,220 --> 00:12:36,216
我不想听
I don't wanna--

330
00:12:36,236 --> 00:12:37,815
我不喜欢搞歪门邪道
I don't like this at all.

331
00:12:37,825 --> 00:12:39,525
你就拿着吧 以防万一
Just hold on to it. Just in case.

332
00:12:39,525 --> 00:12:40,823
好啦 没事
Come on. It's fine.

333
00:12:40,823 --> 00:12:42,603
杰 我要给你看点东西
Jay, I wanna show you something.

334
00:12:42,633 --> 00:12:45,551
一位新西兰的农民教会一头猪翩翩起舞
A farmer in new zealand taught a pig to dance.

335
00:12:46,760 --> 00:12:48,000
瞧人家猪兄那鼻子挺的
See how he keeps his snout up?

336
00:12:55,459 --> 00:12:58,386
对 就是这里
Yep. This is it.

337
00:12:59,131 --> 00:13:00,178
来这儿干嘛
This is what?

338
00:13:00,380 --> 00:13:00,860
这个
This.

339
00:13:03,560 --> 00:13:06,060
我 我做不到 我没办法下车
I-I can't do this. I can't get out of the car.

340
00:13:06,280 --> 00:13:07,520
对不起 我太难为情了
I'm sorry. I'm too embarrassed.

341
00:13:08,240 --> 00:13:09,640
你能不能告诉我到底怎么回事
Would you just tell me what's going on?

342
00:13:09,700 --> 00:13:12,740
好吧 我需要你读一下
Okay. I-I want you to go read

343
00:13:14,280 --> 00:13:16,493
刻在那棵树上的字
what's carved in that tree.

344
00:13:17,449 --> 00:13:18,879
妈 你有点吓着我了
Mom, you're freaking me out.

345
00:13:18,888 --> 00:13:21,443
照做就行了 去读吧 海莉
Just do it. Do it, Haley.

346
00:13:37,840 --> 00:13:40,300
回家路上玩的开心呦
Have fun getting home!

347
00:13:40,780 --> 00:13:42,200
摆在你眼前的就是困难
There's your obstacle!

348
00:13:42,920 --> 00:13:45,820
什么 你跟我开玩笑呢吧
What?! Are you kidding me?!

349
00:13:47,839 --> 00:13:54,548
妈的...
Oh! Son of a...

350
