Maybe I need a nail gun.

352
00:13:59,306 --> 00:14:01,107
得嘞 行了 我不玩了
Okay, that's it! I'm out!

353
00:14:01,107 --> 00:14:02,536
什么意思 你不玩了
What do you mean, you're out?

354
00:14:02,556 --> 00:14:03,562
你去哪啊
Where are you going?

355
00:14:03,592 --> 00:14:05,292
老爸 恕我冒犯
Dad, no offense,

356
00:14:05,292 --> 00:14:06,861
