只要在你身边 我就觉得很心安
because I feel so comfortable around you already.

369
00:14:35,440 --> 00:14:37,140
昨晚我回到家后
You know, last night when I got home,

370
00:14:37,140 --> 00:14:39,011
我就开始想那些
I just started thinking about

371
