我们可以一起做的趣事 知道吗
all of the fun things that we could do together, you know?

372
00:14:42,612 --> 00:14:43,619
是啊
Yeah.

373
00:14:43,638 --> 00:14:44,664
我不想把你吓跑
I don't wanna scare you off,

374
00:14:44,664 --> 00:14:47,089
但是我姐姐几周后就要结婚了
But my sister's getting married in a couple of weeks,

375
00:14:47,089 --> 00:14:50,288
