I don't know why I said that.

383
00:15:08,666 --> 00:15:10,638
我 我是个彻头彻尾的基佬
I'm--I'm totally gay.

384
00:15:12,140 --> 00:15:13,200
基的无可救药
Just gay.

385
00:15:14,720 --> 00:15:16,120
