You overcame an obstacle.

448
00:18:00,500 --> 00:18:02,260
是哦 我做到了
Oh! Yeah! I did!

449
00:18:02,440 --> 00:18:04,700
家有疯母 我很庆幸自己是个正常孩子
I grew up normal despite my crazy mom!

450
00:18:04,780 --> 00:18:06,620
拿这句当你的论文开头挺不错的
Well, that sounds like the beginning of a great essay.

451
00:18:06,620 --> 00:18:07,980
亲爱的大学
"Dear college..."

452
00:18:08,580 --> 00:18:10,740
亲爱的 要是你又卡住了 告诉我
Oh, honey, if you get stuck, let me know,

453
