那人怎么不好了
What was wrong with that guy?

466
00:18:44,310 --> 00:18:45,246
就是啊 我都想和他共舞呢
Yeah, I would have danced with him.

467
00:18:45,246 --> 00:18:46,171
他的肩膀超级正
He's got nice shoulders.

468
00:18:46,171 --> 00:18:48,756
跳莎莎舞要与舞伴亲密接触 欲情荡漾
Aw, you know, Salsa is so intimate and sensual

469
