Aw. You know, Darlene feels the same way.

471
00:18:53,796 --> 00:18:55,667
要是我不在 她会去找道墙
If I wasn't here, she's be holding up the wall.

472
00:18:55,677 --> 00:18:58,252
是啊 男人墙
Yeah. A wall of men.

473
00:18:58,262 --> 00:19:01,441
我觉得我该回家陪我那可爱的老公了
You know, I think I should go home to my loving husband

474
00:19:01,451 --> 00:19:05,093
