为什么你就从未给我这样的惊喜
Home come you never surprise me like that?

490
00:19:46,336 --> 00:19:47,222
我当然给过你惊喜
I do surprise you.

491
00:19:47,222 --> 00:19:49,425
你才没有 你从来都没有
No, you don't. You never surprise me...

492
