一定会是座很了不起的树屋的
That's gonna be a hell of a tree house.

493
00:19:59,860 --> 00:20:02,020
谢谢关心 我正努力呢
Oh, thanks. I'm trying.

494
00:20:02,020 --> 00:20:04,440
本来为我儿子造的 可貌似他失去兴趣了
It's for my son, but he's kind of lost interest.

495
00:20:04,900 --> 00:20:06,700
和我女儿养狗一样
It's kind of like my daughter with the dog.

496
00:20:06,700 --> 00:20:08,580
最后只能由我来拣狗屎了
Which is why I'm the one out here doing this.

497
00:20:09,980 --> 00:20:11,140
你刚搬进来吗
Did you just move in?

498
00:20:11,580 --> 00:20:13,700
都住了8年了 你呢
Lived here eight years. You?

499
00:20:16,364 --> 00:20:17,571
当年我和我的朋友
You know, me and my friends,

500
00:20:17,571 --> 00:20:19,563
儿时造过一个树屋
We, uh, we built a te house when I was a kid.

501
00:20:20,660 --> 00:20:22,060
