我也一样
Me, too.

504
00:20:25,400 --> 00:20:26,380
需要帮忙吗
You need any help?

505
00:20:26,504 --> 00:20:27,732
当然
Yes, a lot.

506
00:20:27,751 --> 00:20:30,115
可我不想麻烦你
But I-I don't wanna bother you.

507
