我找找看 马上就过来
Let me find it. I'll be right over.

513
00:20:41,040 --> 00:20:41,440
多谢啊
Thanks.

514
00:20:41,512 --> 00:20:43,243
顺便提下 我叫菲尔
I'm Phil, by the way.

515
00:20:44,440 --> 00:20:46,440
我叫安德瑞 很高兴认识你 菲尔
I'm Andre. Nice to meet you, phil.

516
00:20:46,700 --> 00:20:47,780
很高兴认识你 安德瑞
Nice to meet you, Andre.

517
00:20:48,320 --> 00:20:50,300
看来我之前说一旦长大后
So I guess I was wrong when I said once you get older,

518
00:20:50,300 --> 00:20:51,760
很难再交到朋友是错的
it's harder to make new friends.

519
00:20:51,803 --> 00:20:54,499
快看 亲爱的 树上那人酷极了
Hey, honey! There's a dude in the tree that's cool!

520
00:20:55,540 --> 00:20:58,060
安德瑞其实是一个整形医生
Andre, it turns out, is an orthopedic surgeon,

521
00:20:58,060 --> 00:21:01,580
任何工具都得心应手 同时也是个好玩伴
Handy with tools, and a great guy to hang out with.

522
00:21:01,860 --> 00:21:04,000
而且 他是个犀利的黑鬼头
Plus he's a badass black man

523
00:21:04,000 --> 00:21:05,380
让我在社区增加不少威望
that gives me extra street cred.

